-- title:
--   Dusart smoothing: Far Point
-- statement:
--   This module gives the complete far point component of Gaussian resampling for Chebyshev’s psi function. It is part of the direct formal proof of the parameter-dependent explicit prime-number-theorem error estimate. Its supporting analytic and numerical results are included with their proofs.
--
--   Formalization Note: The imported components are complete proof modules; no open theorem is assumed.
-- source:
--   Pierre Dusart, Estimates of Some Functions Over Primes without R.H., https://www.unilim.fr/pages_perso/pierre.dusart/Documents/HDR_Dusart.pdf, Theorem 45 and Lemmas 47–55, printed pp. 38–46; supporting analytic and numerical formalization.

import Definitions.Def_dusart_psi_433_20261014_LandauDefs
